{"code":0,"message":"SUCCESS","data":{"tab_index":0,"tab_item":[{"tab_type":8,"client_tab_type":0,"title":"找剧","cell_data":[{"cell_id":6952850996422770718,"show_type":401,"cell_name":"","cell_operation_type":1,"use_recommend":true,"cell_abstract":"","cell_id_str":"6952850996422770718","cell_data":[{"cell_id":6952850996422770718,"show_type":402,"cell_name":"小卡","cell_operation_type":0,"use_recommend":false,"video_data":[{"vid":"7703824211655019582","cover":"https://p3-reading-sign.fqnovelpic.com/novel-pic/80d25f9565ce34f9c664b0fdd79977e8~tplv-81nmtwyey9-superreso-aifit:400:0.image?lk3s=ae45642e&x-expires=1799164571&x-signature=o3U0gaKY6XVcB6jeOVGMnhj7TaQ%3D","duration":6055,"title":"温柔以待，终有回甘","video_desc":"中秋夜，林哲与前妻的儿子林屿浑身湿透找上门，怯生生问能不能借住两天。苏晚挺着孕肚拉住他，说这是你爸的家，想住就住。她发现孩子面黄肌瘦，得知前妻宋丽纵容现任丈夫苛待亲生儿子，便要求林哲降低抚养费，把钱直接花在林屿身上。国庆期间，林屿又遭张浩驱赶出门。苏晚挺着孕肚带他回公司讨说法，宋丽大闹，自称身份不凡。苏晚亮明身份，张浩——她父亲曾经的司机——当场愣住。混乱中，苏晚摔倒了。","series_id":"7703822281448901656","episode":true,"vertical":true,"content_type":1,"recommend_info":"{\"channel_id\":\"94349560332\",\"request_id\":\"202611062356098AD02BEA18A510A97365\",\"rank\":\"1\",\"queue_names\":\"shortplay\",\"final_queue_name\":\"heji\",\"gid\":\"7703822281448901656\",\"plan_id\":\"1\",\"is_show_ad_flag\":\"0\",\"series_pred_score\":\"{\\\"staytime_stream\\\":1.6976677179336548,\\\"finish\\\":0.006488270126283169,\\\"collect\\\":0.03676946833729744,\\\"stream_ctr\\\":0.009959807619452477,\\\"absolute_staytime\\\":0.15946394205093384,\\\"normalized_duration\\\":0.6753135919570923,\\\"like\\\":0.06097517907619476}\"}","recommend_group_id":"7703822281448901656","play_cnt":964,"book_exist":false,"copyright":"快创短剧","sub_title":"家庭·家庭温情","score":"8.6","use_video_model":true,"episode_cnt":84,"video_platform":3,"disable_play":false,"category_schema":"[{\"category_id\":5001,\"name\":\"家庭\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5001&categoryName=家庭&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5048,\"name\":\"家庭温情\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662: