ation":3736,"title":"骂我黑心，假肥毁地全村慌","video_desc":"农大毕业生陈知远回村经营化肥店，以接近成本的价格向村民供肥，并长期允许赊账。其舅舅魏大富见生意可观，联合村长刘德厚以低价化肥为名煽动村民，迫使陈知远关店离村。一个月后，魏大富所售化肥被证实成分不合格，村民田地受损，魏大富卷款离开。村民向陈知远求助，他提出先由村民自行清理受损土地，再提供改良方案。最终魏大富、刘德厚被依法处理，受损土地逐步恢复，望田村实现增产。","series_id":"7700965441081986073","episode":true,"vertical":true,"content_type":1,"recommend_info":"{\"channel_id\":\"94349560332\",\"request_id\":\"202611062356098AD02BEA18A510A97365\",\"rank\":\"8\",\"queue_names\":\"shortplay\",\"final_queue_name\":\"coldstart\",\"gid\":\"7700965441081986073\",\"plan_id\":\"1\",\"is_show_ad_flag\":\"0\",\"series_pred_score\":\"{\\\"normalized_duration\\\":0.6282332539558411,\\\"stream_ctr\\\":0.03506537154316902,\\\"staytime_stream\\\":0.7418047785758972,\\\"absolute_staytime\\\":0.13323712348937988,\\\"finish\\\":0.0222861859947443,\\\"collect\\\":0.03210071101784706,\\\"like\\\":0.05582313612103462}\"}","recommend_group_id":"7700965441081986073","play_cnt":964,"book_exist":false,"copyright":"极剧","sub_title":"剧情·逆袭翻身","score":"8.5","use_video_model":true,"episode_cnt":51,"video_platform":3,"disable_play":false,"category_schema":"[{\"category_id\":5030,\"name\":\"剧情\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5030&categoryName=剧情&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5070,\"name\":\"逆袭翻身\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5070&categoryName=逆袭翻身&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5175,\"name\":\"打脸反派\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5175&categoryName=打脸反派&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5174,\"name\":\"矛盾和解\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5174&categoryName=矛盾和解&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5224,\"name\":\"大男主\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5224&categoryName=大男主&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5336,\"name\":\"极品亲戚\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5336&categoryName=极品亲戚&genre